# Authority of the Consuls: "Creatures your opponents control enter tapped" applies to a token created under an opponent
# by Authority's own controller's spell (CR 614.1c, 111.1, 110.2a): the token is judged as it would exist on the
# battlefield, under the player it enters under (CR 614.12). Bot1 casts Authority, then Fractured Identity on its own
# Ornithopter, so Bot2 creates the token copy: it enters tapped, and its entering gains Bot1 1 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Authority of the Consuls
Fractured Identity
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Authority of the Consuls.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fractured Identity.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Token = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Life = 21
Stack.Count = 0
